itle 503–523, cards 527–657 (h130)\n- Tab bar 760–844. Gap 657→760 = 103 slack. \n\n**04_Workout (390×844)**\n- Hero: Photo_Lower_Body_Training full-width 390×300 with dark gradient, back button (Icon_Back in circle) top-left under status bar, status bar white glyphs.\n- White sheet overlapping with radius 24: title \"Workout\" header? Must include: Header: \"Workout\". So top header has back + \"Workout\" title centered, over hero. Then sheet contains: \"Lower Body Training\" 22 bold; stats row: Time 50 min (Icon_Timer), Burn 500 kcal (Icon_Fire) chips; Description paragraph; \"Rounds\" title + \"1/3\"; round rows: photo thumb, name, time, play icon. \"Let's Workout\" button (Button component instance, but text \"Let's Workout\" — override characters) at bottom.\n- Back → 02_Home.\n\nLayout: hero 0–280; sheet 252–844 (radius 28 top). In sheet: title 280, stats chips 320, desc 360–440, rounds title+1/3 460, rows 3×68 484–700, button 720–776, home indicator 810.\n\nWait must include header \"Workout\": I'll place in the top bar over hero: back button left, \"Workout\" centered white.\n\n**05_Analytics (390×844)**\n- Status bar, header \"Analytics\"? Not required but fine — must include Calendar \"July 2022\". Header: \"Today Report\"? The report section is \"Today Report\". Top: title \"July 2022\" with maybe chevrons. Day strip: S 10, M 11, T 12 (current), W 13, T 14, F 15, S 16, S 17 — 8 days; current T 12 highlighted (charcoal or lime pill).\n- \"Today Report\" section title.\n- Tiles grid 2 cols: Active calories 645 Cal; Training time 80%; then Cycling tile (map full-width with Icon_Cycling); Heart Rate 79 Bpm (Icon_Heart_Rate); Steps 999/2000 (Icon_Steps) with \"Keep it Up! 💪\"; Water 6/8 Cups (Icon_Water); Sleep (Icon_Sleep) with chart (bars, values illustrative).\n- Tab bar Analytics current.\n\nLayout: status 47; header \"July 2022\" y55–90; day strip y100–160 (8 chips w~38); \"Today Report\" y176–198; tiles: row1 y206–310 (two tiles 170×104); cycling y318–43