current page — I'll set current page to 03 · Workspace first. Note: setCurrentPageAsync required.\n\nOne more detail: prototype connections via reactions API:\nframe.reactions = [{ action: { type: 'NODE', destinationId: target.id, navigation: 'NAVIGATE', transition: {type:'SMART_ANIMATE'...} }, trigger: { type: 'ON_CLICK' } }]. For instances (button inside), set reactions on the instance node directly — instances support reactions? Yes, prototype interactions can be added to component instances.\n\nLet me now check Text Field internals + Button internals positions.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"54e5d337-30e6-4fe3-a70b-db321d8e2863","uuid":"cf8c5de9-5b4a-406b-a2ad-2acf90dab85f","timestamp":"2026-11-03T08:44:10.882Z","thinking_duration_ms":117457}
