{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":35240,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"04206ae9a2790a7a645309814b980e59","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Components created. Note components were created at x=-1600 — but they may have been created on current page already (createComponent adds to current page; I appended some to WS explicitly; pop/row/xc/rr appended to WS too).\n\nNow analytics tile components (5 tiles) + sleep chart. Sizes:\n- heart: 166×88\n- steps: 166×88\n- sleep: 166×88\n- water: 166×88\n- cycling: 166×188\n\nTiles white bg, radius 18, padding 14. Structure:\n- header row: icon in small rounded square (24×24 tinted bg) + label 11 bold gray at right of icon\n- value: e.g. \"79 Bpm\" — number 18 Black + unit 11 Bold gray\n- Sleep: tiny bar chart instead: 7 bars heights varying, brand/gray.\n- Water: value \"6/8 Cups\".\n- Cycling: contains map image 138×86 at bottom + Icon_Cycling + label; maybe also small text? Only \"Cycling\" label + icon + map.\n\nHeights 88 for small tiles; width 166.\n\nCreate these as separate components named \"Tile / Heart Rate\", etc.\n\nSleep chart bars: 7 bars, heights [10,16,24,18,28,14,20], widths 10, gap 6, colors: last bar brand lime, others #D9E4EA? or brand dark. Let me: bars charcoal #192126 30% alpha except last lime. I'll draw inside tile.\n\nThen screens. Let me create tiles first.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"54e5d337-30e6-4fe3-a70b-db321d8e2863","uuid":"ba325fee-d724-409f-9b8e-382f0e30d0df","timestamp":"2026-11-03T08:59:52.479Z","thinking_duration_ms":10930}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":35240,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"04206ae9a2790a7a645309814b980e59","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now the analytics tile components, including a small sleep bar chart."}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"54e5d337-30e6-4fe3-a70b-db321d8e2863","uuid":"1c1ddae9-ef77-4a60-876d-590ea63358b9","timestamp":"2026-11-03T08:59:53.224Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":35240,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"04206ae9a2790a7a645309814b980e59","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_14_18dafdc5","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"\nconst WS = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('7:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(WS);\nfor (const s of ['Regular','Bold','Black']) await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Lato',style:s});\nconst C = h => { const n=parseInt(h.slice(1),16); return {r:((n>>16)&255)/255,g:((n>>8)&255)/255,b:(n&255)/255}; };\nfunction rect(w,h,color,r){ const n=figma.createRectangle(); n.resize(w,h); n.fills = color? [{type:'SOLID',color:C(color)}] : []; if(r!==undefined) n.cornerRadius=r; return n; }\nfunction txt(chars,size,style,color,opts={}){ const t=figma.createText(); t.fontName={family:'Lato',style}; t.characters=chars; t.fontSize=size; t.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:C(color)}]; if(opts.lh) t.lineHeight={value:opts.lh,unit:'PIXELS'}; if(opts.align) t.textAlignHorizontal=opts.align; if(opts.w){ t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT'; t.resize(opts.w,10);} return t; }\nconst mediaFrame = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('5:75');\nconst icons = {}; for (const g of mediaFrame.children){ const comp=g.findOne(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT'); if(comp) icons[comp.name]=comp; }\nconst photos = {}; for (const g of (await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('5:41')).children){ const comp=g.findOne(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT'); if(comp) photos[comp.name]=comp; }\nphotos['Map_Cycling_Route'] = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('5:3');\nfunction iconInst(name,size,hex){ const inst=icons[name].createInstance(); inst.resize(size,size); const paint=[{type:'SOLID',color:C(hex)}]; inst.fills=paint; inst.children.forEach(c=>{ try{c.fills=paint; if('children' in c) c.children.forEach(cc=>{try{cc.fills=paint;}catch(e){}});}catch(e){} }); return inst; }\nfunction photoInst(name,w,h,r,scale=1.15){ const inst=photos[name].createInstance(); inst.resize(w,h); inst.cornerRadius=r; const f=inst.fills[0]; inst.fills=[{type:'IMAGE', imageHash:f.imageHash, scaleMode:'FILL', imageTransform:[[scale,0,0],[0,scale,0]]}]; return inst; }\n\n// tile maker: header icon in tinted chip + label, value text (or chart for sleep)\nfunction makeTile(name, iconName, iconColor, iconBg, label, valueNum, valueUnit, extra){\n  const comp=figma.createComponent(); comp.name='Tile/'+name; comp.resize(166,88);\n  comp.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:C('#FFFFFF')}]; comp.cornerRadius=18;\n  const chipBg=rect(26,26,iconBg,9); chipBg.x=12; chipBg.y=12; comp.appendChild(chipBg);\n  const ic=iconInst(iconName,15,iconColor); ic.x=12+5.5; ic.y=12+5.5; comp.appendChild(ic);\n  const lb=txt(label,10,'Bold','#98A3AC'); lb.x=44; lb.y=18; comp.appendChild(lb);\n  if(valueNum!==null){\n    const vn=txt(valueNum,18,'Black','#192126'); vn.x=12; vn.y=48; comp.appendChild(vn);\n    const vu=txt(valueUnit,10,'Bold','#98A3AC'); vu.x=12+vn.width+4; vu.y=56; comp.appendChild(vu);\n  }\n  if(extra==='sleep'){\n    const hs=[9,14,20,15,24,12,17]; const x0=12; \n    hs.forEach((h,i)=>{ const b=rect(12,h, i===6? '#BBF246':'#D9E4EA',4); b.x=x0+i*20; b.y=72-h; comp.appendChild(b); });\n  }\n  comp.x=-1600; comp.y=1300;\n  return comp;\n}\nconst tHeart=makeTile('Heart Rate','Icon_Heart_Rate','#E14D4D','#FBE7E7','Heart Rate','79','Bpm');\nconst tSteps=makeTile('Steps','Icon_Steps','#3A8FD9','#E3F0FA','Steps','999','/ 2000');\nconst tSleep=makeTile('Sleep','Icon_Sleep','#7A5AF5','#EFE9FD','Sleep',null,null,'sleep');\nconst tWater=makeTile('Water','Icon_Water','#2BB3D6','#E2F5FA','Water','6/8','Cups');\n[tHeart,tSteps,tSleep,tWater].forEach((t,i)=>{ t.x=-1600+i*182; t.y=1300; WS.appendChild(t); });\n\n// Cycling tile (wide w/ map)\nconst tCyc=figma.createComponent(); tCyc.name='Tile/Cycling'; tCyc.resize(166,188); tCyc.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:C('#FFFFFF')}]; tCyc.cornerRadius=18;\nconst cb=rect(26,26,'#E8F9D9',9); cb.x=12; cb.y=12; tCyc.appendChild(cb);\nconst ci=iconInst('Icon_Cycling',15,'#4C7A10'); ci.x=17.5; ci.y=17.5; tCyc.appendChild(ci);\nconst clb=txt('Cycling',10,'Bold','#98A3AC'); clb.x=44; clb.y=18; tCyc.appendChild(clb);\nconst map=photoInst('Map_Cycling_Route',142,110,12,1.0); map.x=12; map.y=66; tCyc.appendChild(map);\ntCyc.x=-1600; tCyc.y=1400; WS.appendChild(tCyc);\n\nreturn { tiles: [tHeart.id,tSteps.id,tSleep.id,tWater.id,tCyc.id] };\n","description":"Create analytics tile components (Heart Rate, Steps, Sleep with chart, Water, Cycling with map)","fileKey":"qXY2eMtuSLPDnvn8AwR0hR"}}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"54e5d337-30e6-4fe3-a70b-db321d8e2863","uuid":"24638801-a619-482e-82a9-785852702d76","timestamp":"2026-11-03T09:00:20.686Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_14_18dafdc5","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
