{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":36968,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"02196ae9a2ac0a7a09497c0ce1c47a02","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now create 5 screen frames and the fixed-bottom overlay tab bar + status bar components.\n\nFixed Tab Bar: comp 390×88 transparent fills=[], bar at y0 = bar bg white h54 + divider + tabs icons y8/labels y38, home indicator bar (charcoal) at bottom y=88-21-5... let me do: bar occupies y0..54. Home pill y=83-21=62? Standard iOS home indicator ~8px from bottom edge: y=88-8-5=75. In my earlier tab bar comp I placed at y78 (h5) → bottom 83, 5px margin. For fixed: bar h54 y0..54; icons y=10, labels y=38 (h~12 ends 50). divider y0. home pill y=75.\n\nWait my scroll tab bar comp: 88 tall, bg fills whole, divider y0, icons y16, labels y46, dot y64, pill y78. Slightly off but fine — 02/03/05 use SCROLL tab bar in their design. The fixed tab bar is a separate component used for overlays 02b/03b/05b.\n\nLet me create Fixed Tab Bar (3 variants) + Status Bar wrapper components (light/dark), then screens 01 and 02.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"54e5d337-30e6-4fe3-a70b-db321d8e2863","uuid":"d98dd86e-f20d-423a-8a2a-e5085163d9dd","timestamp":"2026-11-03T09:00:43.808Z","thinking_duration_ms":11047}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":36968,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"02196ae9a2ac0a7a09497c0ce1c47a02","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_15_48c621fa","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"\nconst WS = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('7:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(WS);\nfor (const s of ['Regular','Bold','Black']) await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Lato',style:s});\nconst C = h => { const n=parseInt(h.slice(1),16); return {r:((n>>16)&255)/255,g:((n>>8)&255)/255,b:(n&255)/255}; };\nfunction rect(w,h,color,r){ const n=figma.createRectangle(); n.resize(w,h); n.fills = color? [{type:'SOLID',color:C(color)}] : []; if(r!==undefined) n.cornerRadius=r; return n; }\nfunction txt(chars,size,style,color){ const t=figma.createText(); t.fontName={family:'Lato',style}; t.characters=chars; t.fontSize=size; t.fills=[{type:'SOLID',color:C(color)}]; return t; }\nconst mediaFrame = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('5:75');\nconst icons = {}; for (const g of mediaFrame.children){ const comp=g.findOne(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT'); if(comp) icons[comp.name]=comp; }\nfunction iconInst(name,size,hex){ const inst=icons[name].createInstance(); inst.resize(size,size); const paint=[{type:'SOLID',color:C(hex)}]; inst.fills=paint; inst.children.forEach(c=>{ try{c.fills=paint; if('children' in c) c.children.forEach(cc=>{try{cc.fills=paint;}catch(e){}});}catch(e){} }); return inst; }\n\n// ---- Fixed Tab Bar (transparent wrapper, bottom-anchored for overlays)\nconst tabIcons = {Home:'Icon_Home', Explore:'Icon_Explore', Analytics:'Icon_Analytics', Profile:'Icon_Profile'};\nfunction makeFixedTabBar(current){\n  const comp=figma.createComponent(); comp.name='current='+current; comp.resize(390,88); comp.fills=[];\n  const bg=rect(390,54,'#FFFFFF',0); bg.y=0; comp.appendChild(bg);\n  const line=rect(390,1,'#EAEEF0',0); comp.appendChild(line);\n  const labels=['Home','Explore','Analytics','Profile']; const w=Math.floor(390/4);\n  labels.forEach((lb,i)=>{\n    const cur = lb===current;\n    const ic = iconInst(tabIcons[lb], 24, cur? '#192126':'#B9C2C9'); ic.x=i*w+(w-24)/2; ic.y=9; comp.appendChild(ic);\n    const t=txt(lb,10,cur?'Bold':'Regular',cur?'#192126':'#B9C2C9'); t.x=i*w+(w-t.width)/2; t.y=37; comp.appendChild(t);\n    if(cur){ const dot=rect(4,4,'#BBF246',2); dot.x=i*w+(w-4)/2; dot.y=54+8; comp.appendChild(dot); }\n  });\n  const ind=rect(134,5,'#192126',3); ind.x=128; ind.y=75; comp.appendChild(ind);\n  return comp;\n}\nconst f1=makeFixedTabBar('Home'), f2=makeFixedTabBar('Explore'), f3=makeFixedTabBar('Analytics');\nf1.x=-1600; f1.y=1620; f2.x=-1600; f2.y=1720; f3.x=-1600; f3.y=1820;\nconst ftbSet = figma.combineAsVariants([f1,f2,f3], WS);\nftbSet.name='Tab Bar Fixed'; ftbSet.x=-1600; ftbSet.y=1620;\n\n// ---- Status Bar wrappers (light = dark glyphs, dark = white glyphs)\nfunction makeSB(mode){\n  const comp=figma.createComponent(); comp.name='mode='+mode; comp.resize(390,47); comp.fills=[];\n  const base=(figma.getNodeByIdAsync ? null : null);\n  return comp;\n}\nfunction buildSB(mode, hex){\n  const comp=figma.createComponent(); comp.name='mode='+mode; comp.resize(390,47); comp.fills=[];\n  const t=txt('9:41',13,'Black',hex); t.x=28; t.y=16; comp.appendChild(t);\n  const notch=rect(156,30,'#000000',12); notch.x=117; notch.y=0; comp.appendChild(notch);\n  const paint=[{type:'SOLID',color:C(hex)}];\n  // signal bars\n  [3,6,9,12].forEach((h,i)=>{ const b=rect(3,h,null,1); b.fills=paint; b.x=310+i*5; b.y=24+12-h; comp.appendChild(b); });\n  const wifi=figma.createEllipse(); wifi.resize(14,10); wifi.fills=paint; wifi.x=338; wifi.y=25; comp.appendChild(wifi);\n  const bat=rect(25,12,null,3); bat.strokes=paint; bat.strokeWeight=1; bat.fills=[]; bat.x=360; bat.y=24; comp.appendChild(bat);\n  const batIn=rect(18,7,null,1.5); batIn.fills=paint; batIn.x=362.5; batIn.y=26.5; comp.appendChild(batIn);\n  return comp;\n}\nconst sbL=buildSB('light','#192126'); sbL.x=-1600; sbL.y=1950;\nconst sbD=buildSB('dark','#FFFFFF'); sbD.x=-1600; sbD.y=2010;\nconst sbSet=figma.combineAsVariants([sbL,sbD], WS);\nsbSet.name='Status Bar'; sbSet.x=-1600; sbSet.y=1950;\n\nreturn { ftbSetId: ftbSet.id, sbSetId: sbSet.id };\n","description":"Create fixed bottom Tab Bar variants and Status Bar light/dark wrapper components","fileKey":"qXY2eMtuSLPDnvn8AwR0hR"}}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"54e5d337-30e6-4fe3-a70b-db321d8e2863","uuid":"5e609c06-ba20-4eea-a299-b69e1b6142d9","timestamp":"2026-11-03T09:01:09.724Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_15_48c621fa","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
