{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":65772,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"04026ae9a5810a7af1ab4fb9067e03f0","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Oops I made a mistake with placeholder code — but it executed harmlessly (it fetched the round set id wrongly but didn't use it, only deleted any 04_Workout frames). Wait — it also removed the partial 04_Workout. But did it remove the round variants? No, those exist: rSet was created successfully earlier (\"Round Row\" combined set) — but the call errored AFTER creating rSet. The cleanup code ran: removed partial 04_Workout frame. rSet id unknown but findable by name.\n\nNow write the full 04_Workout build in one careful call with ordering discipline: set layoutPositioning immediately after appendChild for each absolute node.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"54e5d337-30e6-4fe3-a70b-db321d8e2863","uuid":"3e386593-7ef3-48e1-be0e-7830e38a0f1c","timestamp":"2026-11-03T09:12:43.666Z","thinking_duration_ms":5101}
